@host = http://localhost:5189
@bucketId = 1
@materialId = 2

### Listar buckets
GET {{host}}/api/bucket?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Consultar un bucket
GET {{host}}/api/bucket/{{bucketId}}
Accept: application/json

### Consultar los materiales de un bucket
GET {{host}}/api/bucket/{{bucketId}}/materials?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Crear un bucket (opcionalmente con materiales)
POST {{host}}/api/bucket
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Caja numero 4",
  "bucketNumber": 4,
  "materialIds": [1, 2]
}

### Actualizar un bucket
PUT {{host}}/api/bucket/{{bucketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Caja numero 4 actualizada",
  "bucketNumber": 4
}

### Asignar materiales a un bucket
POST {{host}}/api/bucket/{{bucketId}}/materials/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialIds": [1, 2]
}

### Desvincular materiales de un bucket
POST {{host}}/api/bucket/{{bucketId}}/materials/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialIds": [1, 2]
}

### Eliminar un bucket
DELETE {{host}}/api/bucket/{{bucketId}}

